"""Boot each matrix kernel and prove the generations table.

For one lock entry or all: verify the cached vmlinuz and modules
manifest against the lock, boot the kernel under virtme-ng with
forced swiotlb and an emulated NVMe disk, install the deb from
MV_DEB (or use an owner bundle), run doctor and compare verdicts,
then on admitted rows run record with a fixed O_DIRECT workload
under a per-CPU count() bpftrace oracle and compare every
admitted channel. Refused rows must refuse record with exit 3
and no partial capture. Writes one evidence dir per kernel plus
a summary table merged across runs.

Every verdict predicate lives in tests/vm/kernel_matrix.py;
this tool only gathers evidence files and boots guests.
"""

